stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> plan
    plan --> refuse: injected / unsafe input
    plan --> act: safe (tool calls)
    plan --> synthesize: no tool calls
    act --> validate
    validate --> act: more tool calls
    validate --> synthesize: evidence gathered
    synthesize --> validate_plan
    validate_plan --> synthesize: retry (recoverable)
    validate_plan --> refuse: hard-unsafe / exhausted
    validate_plan --> finalize: accepted
    refuse --> [*]
    finalize --> [*]
